  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "20.0.0\n* BREAKING: TradeLineItem.TaxPercent is now decimal? (BT-152 is omitted when null); AddTradeLineItem() taxPercent defaults to null, pass 0m for 0 % lines\n* BREAKING: removed AddTradeeCharge(), SetTaxTotalInAccountingCurrency(), SellerElectronicAddress/BuyerElectronicAddress, TradeLineItem.SetOrderReferencedDocument(), InvoiceValidator and ValidationResult\n* Configurable decimal precision per data type via InvoiceFormatOptions (unit price, quantity, percent, exchange rate, opt-in for line amounts)\n* Item instances (BG-X-84): TradeLineItem.AddIndividualTradeProductInstance() with serial number (BT-X-307) and batch ID (BT-X-306)\n* Missing optional codes are read as null instead of a default value (e.g. BT-X-290, BT-6, allowance/charge reason codes)\n* Format 616 (CCYYWW) rejects weeks the year does not contain\n* New SubjectCodes.AAG",
